🇺🇸🇷🇸NEW VIDEO: Who is Behind Serbia's Student List Movement & Avoiding Those Distracting Away from Facts

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/J9qNb3s3r3A?si=VZzGe_a3BZvt4FQL

▪️Resolving who is behind Serbia’s Student List movement (or any other popular movement) requires research into actual, documented evidence found by following money and associations; 

▪️Beware of attempts across the alternative media to discredit research and analysis through personal attacks that sidestep the topic at hand and the documented research defining the facts regarding it; 

▪️The topic at hand is who is behind the Serbian “Student List” movement and substantial evidence exists that the US has once again organized what it claims is an “organic, spontaneous, leaderless” movement, all popular labels used to cover up US involvement in other, similar movements worldwide, and also inside Serbia itself; 

▪️Whatever Kim Iversen's true intentions actually are, what she has done in practice is distract away from researching who is behind Serbia's Student List, avoid talking about documented evidence of US involvement, and attacking and undermining people trying to share this actual evidence;
